---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const unit = catalog.parts[3].units[4];
const anchorFor = (sectionId) => `#section-${sectionId.replace('.', '-')}`;
---

<section id="source-map" class="chapter-source-map" aria-labelledby="chapter16-source-map-title">
  <h2 id="chapter16-source-map-title">来源地图 | Source Map</h2>
  <p>
    下表只记录 Martin 第 2 版目录定位与网站覆盖状态，不转录教材正文、图表或习题。
    <span lang="en">The table records second-edition locators and site coverage without reproducing textbook prose, figures, or exercises.</span>
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>节 | Section</th>
        <th>Martin 标题 | Martin title</th>
        <th>印刷页 | Printed page</th>
        <th>网站位置 | Site position</th>
        <th>状态 | Status</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {unit.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td>{section.id}</td>
          <td lang="en">{section.title}</td>
          <td>{section.page}</td>
          <td><a href={anchorFor(section.id)}>本页对应段落 | matching section</a></td>
          <td>正文、推导与边界已填充 | body, derivations, and boundaries filled</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="chapter-source-map__supplement">
    <strong>补充定位：</strong>Chapter 10（atomic radial equations）、Chapter 11 与 Appendix J（pseudopotential/all-electron boundary）、Chapters 12–15（plane-wave 与 localized-basis 对照）、Appendices F–I（Coulomb、stress、local densities 与 force expressions）以及 Chapter 17（linearized augmented methods）。
  </p>
  <p class="chapter-source-map__supplement" lang="en">
    <strong>Supplemental locators:</strong> Chapter 10 for atomic radial equations; Chapter 11 and Appendix J for the pseudopotential/all-electron boundary; Chapters 12–15 for plane-wave and localized-basis comparisons; Appendices F–I for Coulomb, stress, local-density, and force expressions; and Chapter 17 for linearized augmented methods.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .chapter-source-map__supplement {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    border-left: 0.25rem solid var(--sl-color-accent);
    padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
  }
</style>
